Third-party pattern inspiration
================================

Portions of the safety pattern catalog in lib/dangerous.patterns are adapted
from ideas and categories in:

  hardstop-patterns
  https://github.com/frmoretto/hardstop-patterns
  Copyright (c) 2026 ClarityDome
  Licensed under the MIT License (see below)

Related project (not vendored as a dependency):

  hardstop
  https://github.com/frmoretto/hardstop

The shipped patterns are a curated, bash-ERE-compatible subset rewritten for
zsh-ai-complete (warn-only). They are not a verbatim copy of the upstream
JavaScript regex library.

